      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BET ON THE RIVER (3) has come from tougher barriers to finish third in his last two outings here. Led from wider and stuck on when beaten 2.6 metres last week so has the speed to take advantage of a more favourable draw. ILLAWONG MUSTANG (7) disappointed as favourite last start but he comes back in grade and was very good prior, missing by just a nose at this circuit and distance. Race fit now so prepared to give him another chance. JIMMY ROCKS (4) was held up last start but had recorded a series of top-three finishes prior including a Pinjarra win two back so he is worth another chance. SUGAR STREET NZ (6) must be respected having come from wider barriers for a win and a second in his last two outings here.",
